      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thank you for all the work you have done on this, Darren.  This will significantly improve OEMs\u0027 ability to diagnose this class of battery life problems that has remained minimally diagnosable for years.",
      "revId": "d5bc54642cc1f9b99c18e73e4402fc45b25d3e3d",
